{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Ultimate Tic-Tac-Toe, a strategic twist on the classic game, played on a 3x3 grid of smaller 3x3 grids. Players take turns placing their marks (X or O), with the first move allowed anywhere. Each subsequent move is determined by the previous one\u2014the small grid you play in corresponds to the position of the last move within its grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player wins a small grid, it\u2019s claimed, and the next time that grid is targeted, the player can place their mark anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to win three small grids in a row, column, or diagonal on the larger grid. This game combines tactical depth and foresight, making it a challenging and engaging experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788320?t=1770841561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788320?t=1770841561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788320/5a82da4f10e3c4691d3108153f3a5f15b8c492ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770841561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788320/5a82da4f10e3c4691d3108153f3a5f15b8c492ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770841561","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Ultimate Tic-Tac-Toe, a strategic twist on the classic game, played on a 3x3 grid of smaller 3x3 grids. Players take turns placing their marks (X or O), with the first move allowed anywhere. Each subsequent move is determined by the previous one\u2014the small grid you play in corresponds to the position of the last move within its grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player wins a small grid, it\u2019s claimed, and the next time that grid is targeted, the player can place their mark anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to win three small grids in a row, column, or diagonal on the larger grid. This game combines tactical depth and foresight, making it a challenging and engaging experience.</p>","developers":["Gato Cake","Alex Foussat"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788320/0ec78da4018984f13bcf03f66f93126618aeabdc/header.jpg?t=1770841561","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788320/1639171268/50595d1746ff68c404af3baf6995b6e7c271241a/1758528127/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759161857","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788320/1639171268/50595d1746ff68c404af3baf6995b6e7c271241a/1758528127/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759161857","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788320/1639171268/50595d1746ff68c404af3baf6995b6e7c271241a/1758528127/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759161857","id":257203812,"name":"Quantictactoe","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203812/86d9122e38009920f57d9a7e03434f4421657e3e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759161857"}],"name":"Quantictactoe","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gato Cake"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"st